{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261123%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 0930　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1415　30庭　法官歐陽浩榮<br/>審91天亂過馬路案　律政司與外聘主控申剔除辯方律師申索｜宣布決定</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官莫子聰<br/>男子涉詐騙高才通及港漂生租金 ｜再提堂<br/>康文署助理文書主任涉使用假破管署文件副本｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>27歲男教師涉向中一男生發裸照｜再提堂<br/>JPEX虛擬資產交易平台案　3人被控洗黑錢｜轉介文件</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>的士司機涉秀茂坪危駕撞斃八旬老婦｜轉介文件</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　7庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>22歲男生涉威脅發布女子私密影像　再涉襲擊事主及要脅對方銷案｜開審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.290470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":458,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:28:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:17:31.806309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:24.748913+00:00","content_hash":"cb0a5c44b8803f5a3d68cf3b4d49d2a789e297f4ca3925bbeb9e6fff33ea92b7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}